  "production_design": [
    "Add a creation-only DirectoryOpen::CreateNew mode with FILE_CREATE=2 to the existing NtCreateFile helper. Existing Create/ExistingRead/ExistingReadWrite/ExistingPathIdentity mode outcomes are retained.",
    "Reuse the exact current-user protected creation descriptor, OBJ_DONT_REPARSE, FILE_OPEN_REPARSE_POINT, FILE_DIRECTORY_FILE, synchronous access, no-delete-sharing policy, and returned-handle type/owner/DACL validation. No chmod, owner reset, ACL repair, path precheck-then-create, or existing-state fallback is added.",
    "Fleet Windows private-directory creation now calls this exclusive creator and drops the validated handle before its original staging/rename sequence. Existing occupied names remain errors. Unix and other-platform implementations are unchanged.",
    "Existing private directory permission/validation and synchronization functions are unchanged. This patch does not qualify unsupported filesystems, repair legacy unsafe roots, or add Windows directory-entry power-loss guarantees."
  ],
